                        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed" 
                           data-en="Scalable, secure, and high-performance infrastructure built to support modern digital ecosystems and enterprise solutions." 
                           data-ar="بنية تحتية قابلة للتوسع، عالية الأداء، وآمنة لدعم الأنظمة الرقمية الحديثة وحلول المؤسسات.">
                            Scalable, secure, and high-performance infrastructure built to support modern digital ecosystems and enterprise solutions.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 3 -->
                    <div class="magnetic-card card-glow-border rounded-3xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-white/10 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-card/40 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 animate-fade-in-up" data-animate="stagger">
