                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3" data-en="Absolute Trust" data-ar="الثقة المطلقة">Absolute Trust</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"
